32:32.600 --> 32:36.320
Yeah. And then you'll need to put
another 100 on top of that

32:36.400 --> 32:40.040
because, well,
you are a fucking wop, mate.

32:41.400 --> 32:42.240
Hmm?

32:43.840 --> 32:44.680
And you.

32:46.080 --> 32:49.000
And then... we have to deal
with the ugly business

32:49.080 --> 32:54.240
of which I've been incredibly clear of,
before I'll need another £500

32:54.320 --> 32:59.840
because like I stated, Tommy Shelby
is a very, very good friend of mine.

33:01.600 --> 33:05.720
Total is down there in black and white.
All right? Crack on.

33:06.080 --> 33:07.120
It's okay.

33:08.760 --> 33:13.680
Mr. Solomons,
I'm gonna be very fucking clear with you.

33:15.000 --> 33:17.800
